{"video_id": "ZAppBGaEGRE", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 15.039999961853027, "end_seconds": 18.479999542236328, "text": "de inteligencia y empresas para manipular a la opinión pública.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
